---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import MediaBackdrop from '../components/MediaBackdrop.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="软件下载 - LX-M Music"
  description="LX-M Music 桌面版下载：自动发现可用加速镜像 · 按您的网络实测 · 自动预选最快节点"
  active="/download"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <MediaBackdrop sources={['img:https://t.alcy.cc/moez', 'img:https://t.alcy.cc/ycy']} />
    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1>软件下载</h1>
      <p>自动发现可用加速镜像 · 按您的网络实测 · 自动预选最快节点</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="download-layout">
      <section class="panel" id="release-panel">
        <div class="release-head">
          <div class="preload-box" id="release-loading">正在获取版本…</div>
        </div>
        <div id="release-meta" class="release-meta" hidden></div>
        <div class="release-notes markdown-body" id="release-notes" hidden></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <div class="panel-flex">
          <div>
            <h2 class="panel-title">镜像测速</h2>
            <p class="panel-desc">
              由您的浏览器基于本机网络实时探测，结果因地区与运营商而异；测速完成后自动预选最快节点，也可以在下方卡片中手动切换。<span
                id="discovered-note"></span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="speed-actions">
            <span class="speed-count" id="speed-count">共 … 个节点</span>
            <button class="btn btn-tonal" id="retest-btn" type="button" disabled>测速中…</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mirror-chips" id="mirror-chips">
          <span class="mirror-hint">正在准备镜像清单…</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div id="error-box" hidden></div>

      <div class="platforms-grid" id="platforms-grid">
        <div class="panel preload-box" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">正在加载下载列表…</div>
      </div>

      <section class="section" style="padding: 8px 0 0;">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>安装说明</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-grid">
          <div class="guide-card">
            <h3>Windows</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><b>Setup.exe</b>：标准安装版，支持自动更新</li>
              <li><b>portable.exe</b>：便携版，单文件免安装</li>
              <li><b>green.7z</b>：绿色版，解压即用</li>
              <li><b>x64 / x86 / arm64</b>：64 位、32 位与 ARM 架构</li>
              <li><b>win7_ 前缀</b>：Windows 7/8/8.1 兼容版（基于 Electron 22）</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="guide-card">
            <h3>macOS</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><b>.dmg</b>：通用安装包，拖入 Applications 即可</li>
              <li><b>x64 / arm64</b>：Intel 芯片与 Apple Silicon（M 系列）</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="note">当前版本暂未提供 macOS 安装包，可关注后续 Release</p>
          </div>
          <div class="guide-card">
            <h3>Linux</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><b>.deb</b>：Debian / Ubuntu 系</li>
              <li><b>.rpm</b>：Fedora / RHEL 系</li>
              <li><b>.AppImage</b>：通用格式，无需安装</li>
              <li><b>.pacman</b>：Arch Linux 系</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="note">当前版本暂未提供 Linux 安装包，可关注后续 Release</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="safety-box">
        <h3>安全提示</h3>
        <p>
          如果杀毒软件报毒，请先确认软件是从本页面或 GitHub Release 下载的。确认为官方渠道下载后，大概率是误报；加速镜像仅代理官方
          Release 文件，下载后可比对 Release 页中的 SHA-256 校验值。我们不对第三方渠道下载的安全性作任何保证。
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 300px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-text {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }
  .hero-text h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.6vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .hero-text p {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }
  .panel-flex {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .speed-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .speed-count {
    color: var(--text-faint);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .mirror-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    max-height: 380px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding-right: 4px;
  }
  .mirror-hint {
    color: var(--text-faint);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
  }
  .platforms-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(420px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .platforms-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

<script src="../scripts/download-client.ts"></script>
